config.description:
Per-provider parameter shape. Each provider documents its own keys. Common shapes of the canonical catalog (re-homed from v1 `run-options.md` §Canonical mock provider catalog by RFC 0266) (informative — not enforced at this schema level since providers are pluggable):

  - stream-text: { tokens: string[], delayMsPerToken?: integer, finishReason?: string, usage?: object, model?: string }
  - tool-calls: { toolCalls: object[], delayMsPerToken?: integer }
  - error: { code: string, message: string, retryable?: boolean, failAfterMs?: integer }
  - usage-only: { usage: object }
